SUMMARY:Nadine & Sammy in Concert
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $25-$15 sliding scale\nPayPal\, Venmo\, and cash accepted at the door\nRSVP recommended via Facebook event or email Genevieve.Koester@gmail.com \nNadine Landry and Sammy Lind play traditional fiddle music that has been passed on for hundreds of years\, classics of the south west Louisiana Cajun dance halls and songs that could have filled a 50s bar jukebox. They live on the east coast of Quebec where Nadine grew up. Equally comfortable on guitar and upright bass\, she has leant her talents to various bands ranging from old time to honky tonk to swing and Cajun. Described as deeply passionate and powerful\, her voice has been capturing the hearts of fans across the world. Born in Minnesota\, Stephen “Sammy” Lind has established himself as one of the most critically acclaimed old time fiddle players in the country. His playing reflects tremendous respect and passion for all the fiddle players and old recordings he spent countless hours learning from. Alternating between fiddle\, banjo\, guitar and accordion\, they play true to the roots of American music with energy and respect. They are members of the Foghorn Stringband and play with Cajun extraordinaires Jesse Lege\, Joel Savoy and the Cajun Country Revival and have collaborated with living legends including Alice Gerrard\, Dirk Powell and more. \nFacebook: www.facebook.com/NadineandSammy\nInstagram: @nadineandsammy\nWebsite: www.nadineandsammy.com
URL:https://www.lotusfest.org/event/nadine-sammy-in-concert/
LOCATION:Lotus Firebay\, 105 S Rogers Street\, Bloomington\, IN\, 47404\, United States
CATEGORIES:Lotus Performance
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://www.lotusfest.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IMG_1459.webp
END:VEVENT
