SUMMARY:Desserts from Around the World
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Desserts from Around the World Fundraiser! during First Friday Gallery Walk\nLive Music\, Dancing\, Silent Auction\, & A Chance to Win a Dessert every 15 minutes!\nHelp us raise $100\,000 by the end of the year!\nBuy Tickets \nShow us your dance moves and take a turn around the world for a chance to win a delicious dessert! \nEach ticket is $25 and gives you 1 entry to participate in the Dessert-walk.\nThere will be three circles of 12 participants each round\, for a total of 36 spots to participate every round.\nRounds will occur every 15 mins starting from 5:30 – 7:45 PM – purchase your tickets for every time slot you want to participate in. \n2 Musical Guests will join us: Lamont Pearley\, playing the blues\, and Sweetclover Brigade\, playing Celtic tunes! The musicians will alternate short musical sets and play a melody for each round. There will be three winners per round\, so your odds of winning will always be good. Enjoy live music and practice your moves\, dress in your fanciest duds or your most comfortable workout clothes\, and support Lotus while having fun with friends and family. \nThe Silent Auction will open online on November 20th and end on December 4th at 8:00 PM \nWine\, beer\, na beverages\, and light refreshments will be available throughout the evening. \nAll desserts are donated by incredible local bakeries\, restaurants\, and dessert makers in our community. If you are interested in donating a dessert please email administrativeassistant@lotusfest.org \nView more info and buy tickets \nLamont Pearley \nSweet Clover Brigade
URL:https://www.lotusfest.org/event/desserts-from-around-the-world/
LOCATION:Lotus Firebay\, 105 S Rogers Street\, Bloomington\, IN\, 47404\, United States
CATEGORIES:Firebay Rental
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://www.lotusfest.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/desserts.webp
